From: mesen-for-ai local compatibility fixes
Subject: [PATCH] Lua: preserve SetInput parameter positions

LuaCallHelper already enforces the three SetInput arguments. Do not append a
fourth stack value before reading them, because that shifts port and subport.

Validated against MesenCE commit 20ba206cef5ba207c21203176d02cb9f43dda9fb.

diff --git a/Core/Debugger/LuaApi.cpp b/Core/Debugger/LuaApi.cpp
index 179a2a0..382f547 100644
--- a/Core/Debugger/LuaApi.cpp
+++ b/Core/Debugger/LuaApi.cpp
@@ -875 +874,0 @@ int LuaApi::SetInput(lua_State* lua)
-	lua_settop(lua, 4);
